+`createRentalService()` (from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory service with `addEquipment`, `quote`,
+`book` and `availability`. Money is integer euro cents; times are ISO-8601 UTC strings. A period starts and ends at
 midnight UTC and `end` is the start of the day after the last rented day, so `2026-07-01T00:00:00Z` to
